{"parse": {"title": "飞渡往日-01", "pageid": 55483, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">飞渡往日-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-02\" title=\"飞渡往日-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">飞渡往日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.87.8C.E6.96.AF.E6.9C.AC.E5.85.89.E8.8D.A3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"里斯本光荣\">里斯本光荣</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 里斯本光荣</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Glory Days in Lisbon</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1960101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当一个人尝试过飞行的滋味，<br /><br />他便会时时仰望天空，<br /><br />看着他曾到访过的地方，<br /><br />并渴望能够再次回到那儿。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空气中弥漫着柠檬与月桂的淡香。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>西风猎猎作响，自大洋彼岸凶猛袭来，轮船因之被封锁在港湾，加之当局管控，无法出海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1835年夏天，里斯本城中人心惶惶，前往新世界的船票一票难求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大海不再向人们敞开，而天空却依旧畅通无阻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>准备好了吗，希梅娜？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>没问题！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>三、二、一……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着机械女士的倒数号令，她的小助手深深吸了一口气，随后张开双臂——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一对由金属、木材和皮革鼓膜制成的“翅膀”将其延展伸长，拍动着向前奔跑，随后一跃而起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>对了，露西，对了！我飞起来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>很好，就是这样，我保持住，保持，保——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不走运。这儿又多了一只落水的飞鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>九秒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>比上一次的成绩好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>需要帮忙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>呃……谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落水之人爬回海岸，甩甩头发，扯下攀附上肩膀的螃蟹，扔向一旁，再解开摔坏的飞行翼背带，坐在沙滩上叹气摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是风的问题，或者说，动力问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>再改善一下机械结构，应该可以飞得更久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>花了一个月的时间，居然只让滞空时间延长了三秒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>这东西真的能行吗？爸爸一定是疯了才会研究这玩意儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她有些失落，似乎为研究进展如此缓慢而头疼。身后不远处，坐在渔船船头的少年们嘲笑着这出不切实际的闹剧，对她发出一阵阵哄笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落水之人狠狠盯向取笑的旁观者，这才叫那赤裸裸的嗤笑收敛起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们只花了一个月的时间，就基于之前的成果提升了百分之五十，这是个不错的成绩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你还真是乐观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>把衣服擦干，我想我知道问题在哪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>照这个速度，一百年之后咱们就能从海角这一边飞到另一边了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>不过，我倒是希望能赶紧飞到大海对岸呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>想想，这真好……挥着翅膀飞过大西洋，然后稳稳落在新英格兰的温暖海岸，啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>跟上我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>啊，来啦，来啦来啦——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人离开城郊海岸，带着被海水浸湿的装备匆匆赶回城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几艘小船浮在外海，仿佛露出海面的鲨鱼鳍，远远巡游海中，伺机而动。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>太阳行将落山，城市恢复了它一如往常的喧闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你觉得是为什么？因为风不够大，还是我太重了？听说亚洲人会玩一种叫风筝的玩具……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>跑着跑着就能靠着风，把纸和木头送上天，在天上飞得又高又远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你说我们能不能也整个大风筝，把人送上天？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走在机械女士身旁，连哼带笑，不久前的失落似乎被一扫而空，里斯本温暖而吵闹的夜晚让人心情愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身旁之人却没有搭理她的问话。金属机械构筑而成的大脑中，正在复盘这次实验的种种细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>应该加上一对辅助翼，在第二关节靠里十厘米的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>翅膀展开后再启动它，风是目前我们唯一可以倚靠的动力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你在听我说话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小助手跳到机械女士身前，双手叉腰，拦住她的前路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>风筝很轻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你的意思是，我很重？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>成年人的体重不会比纸和木头组成的玩具轻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>风筝能承载的重量有限，远不如我们的设计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坡道尽头传来争吵，随后是士兵的呵斥与醉鬼的谩骂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一队卫兵押送着今夜的“斩获”，钻出酒馆狗洞，用长戟驱赶着“犯人”向市政厅走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>看来传闻是真的，他们在抓城里的走私犯同伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>……只要是他们认定与走私犯有关的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>和我们无关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>那几个人都是神秘学家，“断臂”费尔南德斯，“金手”卡洛斯，还有“鱼鳃”阿方索……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小助手一一列出她勉强看清的熟面孔，脸色越发惊惧——每一个都是混迹于港口附近的神秘学家，也都是土生土长的里斯本人，无一例外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>当然喽，你又不是这儿的人。国王陛下对外国人向来礼遇有加。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>更何况，你还有那个科算中心的介绍信，谁敢跟英国来的客人动粗呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>如果我会飞，我就会从他们头顶上一边笑一边飞过去，让他们抓不到我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是吗？我只是受科算中心安排来里斯本，出发前他们就办好了全套文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我不关心那些琐事，毫无价值的行政手续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你父亲留下的备用材料在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>教堂，东边的圣乔治教堂，那儿已经没人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抱着被海水浸湿的机器，两三步抢到前头，为不熟悉里斯本的伙伴领路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>帮我盯着点，如果有卫兵，我俩就绕路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>别担心，那边都是穷人扎堆的地方，老爷们和老爷们的狗不喜欢往东边去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但有的狗比别的狗更聪明，也更狡猾，知道在什么地方更能逮到猎物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>安静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>前面有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如她所说。希梅娜敏捷地转身躲入墙角的阴影下，将手中紧抱着的飞行器塞进机械女士怀中，眨眼间便藏进了公寓土楼构成的迷宫中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>嘘，前面，露西，我们在那家伙右手边的下一个路口碰头。祝你好运！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轻声说罢，随着脚步声消失在回廊中，希梅娜的身影也匿入城市的秘密世界，无影无踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士从卫兵身边走过，而对方显然对她怀中的金属玩意儿更感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-560701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卫兵：</div><div>你带的什么东西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>石头，木头，皮革，布料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以及一枚小小的、象征着遥远日不落帝国之君主王权的双狮纹章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>用这些组合起来的翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卫兵打量着她和她怀里的东西，一阵沉默后，示意她过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士不紧不慢地走过街巷，到约定的地方与同伴碰面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>没为难你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你都跟他说了什么？这么简单就放你过来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我告诉他这是翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>哈哈哈哈哈哈，他大概当你是个怪人，也不像是要抓的人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>不过没关系，走不多久就是教堂了，但愿藏在布道台里的东西还没有被那儿的穷人们瓜分了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>他们要那些东西做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>什么都缺，什么都要，石头可以垒房子，布料和皮革可以取暖，木材可以烧火……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你能想到的，他们都能用上，尤其现在日子越来越难过……我真想赶紧完成爸爸的遗愿，把这东西造出来，然后带着它去新大陆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>恐怕不会很快，还有不少难题要解决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>越来越多的难题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个问题引出下一个问题，仿佛藤上生出的新枝，需要一一修剪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>解决一个问题要一个月，那一百个问题岂不是要花上好多年？天哪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你父亲为此花了十年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>以及自己的性命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>我不明白这是为什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>能够飞到天上去当然很有意思，但是……什么时候才能做到呢？而且，这真的值得吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>乡绅嘲笑蒸汽车跑得比他们最慢的驮马拉的马车更慢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但我丝毫不怀疑，那些排出滚滚浓烟的机械巨物才是我们的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>你想说，这个只能在天上飞九秒钟，然后就噗通一下跌下来的翅膀，也是我们的未来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她毫不犹豫，也无需思考，她的答案就在她那颗澎湃不息的活塞核心上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>好吧，那我们就去“从前的地方”找找看通往未来的路吧。喏，到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一座教堂，砖墙斑驳，战火摧毁了天使石雕的翅膀，神圣荡然无存。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但愿你父亲留下的东西都还在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-515901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">希梅娜：</div><div>在布道台底下的密室仓库，你去吧，我到周围打听消息，待会儿就来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "飞渡往日-01"}}